  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252farclightsmp.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://files.catbox.moe/ikdage.gif\" width=\"468\" height=\"60\"></a><br><strong>廣告：</strong>Arclight SMP - 隨您怎麼玩。請記住其他人也可以這樣做。自訂生物群系、300+ 建築、危險怪物、自訂附魔、技能、可復活的寵物以及城鎮。在領地範圍外允許 PvP 與襲擊。實驗性太空探索（可能會保留或移除）。唯一規則：禁止作弊。<br><strong>Java (1.9-1.21.11)：</strong>play.arclightsmp.com | <strong>Bedrock：</strong>連接埠 19199<br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>無邊框玻璃（Borderless Glass）是一款簡潔輕量的資源包，透過移除所有類型玻璃方塊的邊框來提升您的 Minecraft 體驗。告別難看的邊框，讓您的建造作品擁有更乾淨、更具沉浸感的玻璃外觀。此資源包廣泛相容於各版本的 Minecraft，讓您能依據自己的遊玩環境選擇合適的版本。立即下載，為您的玻璃方塊帶來流暢無縫的視覺效果！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JtZ7K577Pt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong>加入 Discord 伺服器</strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>此外，還請查看：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mahis-connected-grass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mahi 的連線草</a><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mahis-better-sky\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mahi 的優質天空</a><br><br></strong></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/deadworld-survival-zombie-apocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>DeadWorld 生存：喪屍末日（模組整合包）：</strong></a><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/deadworld-survival-zombie-apocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在敵對的世界中倖存於無休止的喪屍末日，任何聲音、氣味和光線都會招來危險。配備現代武器，您需要策略與技巧來應對嚴酷的環境與不斷逼近的喪屍大軍。</a><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/845743/description_db3e065c-2342-493e-a8ca-77806fcf771e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"487\"><br></strong></span></p>",
